    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d481">

                <pb facs="0666" n="572" xml:id="pg572"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr.
                            Knight.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-02-05"><hi rendition="#small-caps">February</hi> 5,
                            1896</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Report fully on present situation of Hammond and other arrested Americans. Has
                    Hammond been admitted to bail? When will trial take place?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
